1
00:00:00,456 --> 00:00:04,206
HOWARD: I really don't think
the colonoscopy was necessary.

2
00:00:06,003 --> 00:00:07,463
(Leonard:)Before you got all swollen up...

3
00:00:07,629 --> 00:00:10,469
...I thought you're trying to keep me out
of the apartment...

4
00:00:10,632 --> 00:00:12,722
(Leonard:)...so you could throw me
a surprise party.

5
00:00:12,885 --> 00:00:14,555
(Howard:)Oh, right, it's your birthday.

6
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,930
(Howard:)I had no idea it was your birthday.
I forgot.

7
00:00:17,097 --> 00:00:20,727
(Howard:)What a lousy way to spend a birthday.
Well, it's all over now.

8
00:00:24,229 --> 00:00:25,729
There is a party, isn't there?

9
00:00:26,899 --> 00:00:28,609
(Leonard:)Maybe.

10
00:00:28,776 --> 00:00:30,106
(Leonard:)Howard.

11
00:00:31,153 --> 00:00:34,323
- Are you mad?
- How could I be mad?

12
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:38,080
(Leonard:)You actually risked your life
because you care about me.

13
00:00:39,536 --> 00:00:41,916
(Howard:)Yeah, that's why I did it.

14
00:00:44,333 --> 00:00:47,293
All right, here we go.

15
00:00:48,253 --> 00:00:50,923
(Leonard:)My first birthday party.

16
00:00:51,465 --> 00:00:52,925
[SINGING CYNDI LAUPER'S
"TRUE COLORS"]

17
00:00:53,092 --> 00:00:54,472
I see your true colors

18
00:00:54,927 --> 00:01:00,027
And that's why I love you

